# Malayalam conjuncts and a spacing vowel sign under cluster-width =
# double, the default (ADR-1006 D1). Kssma, three consonants joined by two
# viramas, is one cluster and takes two cells, the most a cluster takes.
# Stri, with the vowel sign ii, takes two cells, and so does ko, ka with
# the spacing vowel sign o.
# spec: Python wcwidth 0.9.4's specification, "Virama Conjunct Formation" and "Width of 2"; ADR-1006 D1, D2
# covers: text.grapheme
size 10 2
send "\u{D15}\u{D4D}\u{D37}\u{D4D}\u{D2E}"
dump state
send "\u{D38}\u{D4D}\u{D24}\u{D4D}\u{D30}\u{D40}\u{D15}\u{D4A}"
dump state
